@SplitPayment.InvoiceApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@SplitPayment.InvoiceApi_Key = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_API_KEY

### Health
GET {{SplitPayment.InvoiceApi_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

###

### List synthetic checkout products
GET {{SplitPayment.InvoiceApi_HostAddress}}/api/v2/demo/products
X-API-Key: {{SplitPayment.InvoiceApi_Key}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a sandbox checkout (requires Mercado Pago TEST credentials and an HTTPS webhook tunnel)
POST {{SplitPayment.InvoiceApi_HostAddress}}/api/v2/demo/checkouts
X-API-Key: {{SplitPayment.InvoiceApi_Key}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-checkout-00000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "demo-item-001",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### Informational IBS/CBS test calculation (synthetic scenario only)
POST {{SplitPayment.InvoiceApi_HostAddress}}/api/v2/demo/tax-calculations
X-API-Key: {{SplitPayment.InvoiceApi_Key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taxBase": 1000.00,
  "referenceDate": "2026-10-28"
}

###
